#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A free IBM course on utility-scale quantum computing featuring realistic use"
" cases and best practices"
msgstr ""
"Kursus IBM percuma tentang pengkomputeran kuantum berskala utiliti yang "
"menampilkan kes penggunaan realistik dan amalan terbaik"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Keseluruhan"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran Keseluruhan {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-"
"practice/hero.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-"
"practice/hero.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course focuses on today's quantum computers and how to use them to "
"their full potential. It covers realistic potential use cases for quantum "
"computing as well as best practices for running and experimenting with "
"quantum processors having 100 or more qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini memberi tumpuan kepada komputer kuantum hari ini dan cara "
"menggunakannya sepenuhnya. Ia merangkumi kes penggunaan berpotensi yang "
"realistik untuk pengkomputeran kuantum serta amalan terbaik untuk "
"menjalankan dan bereksperimen dengan pemproses kuantum yang mempunyai 100 "
"qubit atau lebih.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Latar belakang yang disyorkan {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To make the most out of this course, we recommend a familiarity with quantum"
" information and quantum circuits, at the level explained in the [Basics of "
"quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) "
"course.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk memanfaatkan kursus ini sepenuhnya, kami mengesyorkan kebiasaan dengan"
" maklumat kuantum dan litar kuantum, pada tahap yang dijelaskan dalam kursus"
" [Asas maklumat kuantum](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
